## Surface depth and theme (summary)

Before any depth, tint, elevation, theme or CSS-token change, read `.claude/rules/theme-and-depth.md`: adjacent desk depths must differ by at least 10 CIE76 ΔE on all 12 census themes (measured with `tools/desk_depth_check.py`, owner 2026-10-12), and `packages/dark-roast/` is a stale v3.0.0 vendored copy whose `crater` value differs from v5.

