## Subsystem pointers

- Progress-note pipeline files carry a same-PR doc rule: `.claude/rules/progress-note-pipeline.md`.
- Any H&P prompt or rule change: read `.claude/rules/handp-corpus.md` first. The ten P0 rulings are owner decisions, and some make the current code the wrong side.
- Note-evolution, north-star or takeover work: open `docs/architecture/NOTE_EVOLUTION_DATAFLOW.md` first (`.claude/rules/note-evolution.md`).
- Transfer Center work: `.claude/rules/transfer-center.md` holds the Avera facts and the normative Transfer Event Contract rules.

