## Browser automation (summary)

Start with `playwright-cli` (shell, about 27K tokens a task). Escalate to the Playwright MCP plugin only for long multi-step flows, and use Chrome DevTools MCP for performance, Lighthouse, accessibility and network work. Details and the anti-bot notes: `.claude/rules/browser-automation.md`.

